# Environment variables (local only — never commit real values)
#
# The dashboard is a static export. Netlify builds do NOT need any API keys.
# Do not add GEMINI_API_KEY (or any secret) as a Netlify environment variable,
# and never prefix a secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_ (that would ship it to the browser).
#
# Optional local-only leftover from an older Gemini ingest path (unused):
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Copy this file to .env.local for any local secrets:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
